            "review_title": "Review at Juicize Go",
            "review_text": "Travis M\n11 contributions\n0\nGreat smoothie, salad was disappointing\nJan 2017 • Couples\nOrdered the strawberry chocolate smoothie with my salad. The smoothie was superb, but the salad left me slightly disappointed. The chicken was delicious, the the salad was drenched in the dressing, resulting in the lettuce to be soaked at the bottom of the bowl. \n\nIf you're coming for the smoothies, I highly recommend them, but if you're looking for food, I would suggest going elsewhere.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2017",
