            "review_title": "Review at Juicize Go",
            "review_text": "Wandering Alex\nLos Angeles, California9 contributions\n0\nSmoothie waiting for train to Sapa\nSep 2016\nWaiting for the train to Sapa on Hanoi. Leaves at 9:30pm.\nCame and got a nice cold smoothie\nSitting in Juicize Go.\nAir conditioning and have wifi and let me charge all my devices.\nThe two employees were very warm and friendly and inviting.\nGreat view of the street.\nGood pictures.\nLet me stay till I was ready to go.\nClose at 10pm\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2016\nphương b\nHope to see you again when you comeback to Ha Noi\nHave a safe trip\nWritten October 3, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
